{
 "duration": 26.896,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Emma expected the Grand Canyon to be warm.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 2.863
  },
  {
   "text": "At the South Rim there was snow, and the first switchbacks below the rim were packed ice.",
   "start": 3.563,
   "end": 8.103
  },
  {
   "text": "In winter the upper trails can stay icy long after a storm, even when it's milder down in the canyon.",
   "start": 8.803,
   "end": 14.83
  },
  {
   "text": "The park recommends traction devices on icy trails.",
   "start": 15.53,
   "end": 18.524
  },
  {
   "text": "She turned around, came back the next morning with microspikes, and checked conditions first.",
   "start": 19.224,
   "end": 24.425
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your winter trip.",
   "start": 25.125,
   "end": 26.696
  }
 ],
